  "text_md": "Fig. S10 Normalized UV-Vis spectra of the CH3NH3PbI3 perovskite films annealed with and without the PbI2 cap.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nFig. S11 Schematic of the structure of the fabricated perovskite solar cell.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nTable S1 Summary of the PV performance parameters of the fabricated perovskite solar cell with the CH3NH3PbI3 perovskite film annealed with the PbI2 cap, TiO2 cap, or without cap.\n\n| Sample        |   Jsc(mA/cm 2 ) |   Voc(V) |   FF |   PCE(%) |\n|---------------|-----------------|----------|------|----------|\n| With PbI2 cap |           23.41 |     1.07 | 0.70 |    17.57 |\n| Without cap   |           22.62 |     1.05 | 0.60 |    14.19 |\n| With TiO2 cap |           19.28 |     0.99 | 0.66 |    12.62 |",
